    "name": "IQ mixer / up-converter board",
    "category": "instrument",
    "parent": "rack_A",
    "function": "Single-sideband up-converter that multiplies the AWG I and Q envelopes with the local oscillator to place a pulse at f_LO + f_IF. Imperfections are the calibrated parameters: LO leakage (a carrier at the qubit's neighbourhood even with no pulse) and image sideband from amplitude and phase imbalance. Both are nulled by DC offsets and I/Q skew corrections in the mixer-calibration tool.",
